OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man injured in
OL,4,Avillage dies in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Ayrshire have made an arrest
OL,7,Fafter the death of a man who was found
OL,8,Finjured in a street in Dundonald.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Main Street in
OL,11,Fthe village about 04:05 on Sunday after
OL,12,Freports of an "unresponsive man with
OL,13,Finjuries".
OL,15,FEmergency services went to the scene
OL,16,Fand the 57-year-old man was taken to
OL,17,FCrosshouse Hospital in Kilmarnock where
OL,18,Fhe died a short time later. His family
OL,19,Fis aware.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
